(text "FORWARD / BACK BUTTONS\nMomentary push buttons, wired GPIO -> button -> GND.\nNo external resistors: the firmware enables the\ninternal pull-ups (INPUT_PULLUP), pressed = LOW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45.72 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "689aea94-5560-4c6e-909d-125b0857e6c6"))
(text "STATUS LED (optional)\nGPIO10 -> 220R -> LED anode, cathode -> GND.\nSolid while a BLE client is connected,\nblinks on each press. Set LED_PIN = 255\nin the firmware to build without it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 154.94 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "649e21d6-bfa1-4fcc-9df4-6b00383a9279"))
(text "ESP32-C3 SuperMini\nPowered and flashed over its USB-C port.\nBLE uses the onboard radio and antenna.\nDo NOT put buttons on GPIO2/8/9:\nthey are boot strapping pins\n(GPIO9 = BOOT button, GPIO8 = onboard LED)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 109.22 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a2c5bd97-f397-46f7-af28-e331c9a0eb7f"))
(text "Pin map (must match firmware/ArduinoRemote/ArduinoRemote.ino)\n  BUTTON_FORWARD_PIN = GPIO0  -> SW1\n  BUTTON_BACK_PIN    = GPIO1  -> SW2\n  LED_PIN            = GPIO10 -> R1 + D1\n  GND                = any SuperMini GND pin" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45.72 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6a601cee-9c85-4d8d-9d2d-c8dc4a907ee8"))
